{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They See Us</strong> is a horror anomaly-hunting experience inspired by psychological horrors like 'Cabin Factory' and '<i>The Exit 8</i>' with the added chaos of multiplayer and deadly traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/856884106158d0a68ebc22aa3eca11bc.poster.avif?t=1757246534\" width=594 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/856884106158d0a68ebc22aa3eca11bc.webm?t=1757246534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/856884106158d0a68ebc22aa3eca11bc.mp4?t=1757246534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of countless <strong>Cipactli Dynamics</strong> employees. Your newly allocated job is to explore the dark Office Creation and report the number of anomalies you find.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Correct answers progress you to the next stage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incorrect answers will result in death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/546e0ad456bd62ac372b6f12102f583f.poster.avif?t=1757246534\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/546e0ad456bd62ac372b6f12102f583f.webm?t=1757246534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/546e0ad456bd62ac372b6f12102f583f.mp4?t=1757246534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/594e67c248cb40881d4f3a139fcde353.poster.avif?t=1757246534\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/594e67c248cb40881d4f3a139fcde353.webm?t=1757246534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/594e67c248cb40881d4f3a139fcde353.mp4?t=1757246534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-4 human players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VOIP.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ Anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convenient 'clicker' counter to keep track of anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lockers to hide in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team video feeds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matchmaking and Steam Friend invitations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Petable Dog.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/2932fa284fc7aa3b74f624cc1897efdf.poster.avif?t=1757246534\" width=594 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/2932fa284fc7aa3b74f624cc1897efdf.webm?t=1757246534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/2932fa284fc7aa3b74f624cc1897efdf.mp4?t=1757246534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/c0d1ea